    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44110" root="&#xA;                        نقل&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُقْلٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Dried</i> and <i>other fruits</i> (such as <i>nuts,
almonds, raisins, dried figs, dried dates,</i> &amp;c.),
[and <i>comfits:</i>] the <i>fruit</i> [<i>that is an accompaniment</i>] <i>of wine;</i> (MA in explanation of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُقْلٌ</span>
[which is more common than <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقْلٌ</span>];) <i>fruit that
is eaten with wine.</i> (KL in explanation of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُِقْلٌ</span>.)

